   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [ernie-image-turbo.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ERNIE-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ernie-image-turbo.safetensors) | 16.07 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [ministral-3-3b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ERNIE-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/ministral-3-3b.safetensors) | 7.72 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [ernie-image-prompt-enhancer.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ERNIE-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/ernie-image-prompt-enhancer.safetensors) | 6.88 GB |\n| `vae/` | [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ERNIE-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | 0.34 GB |\n\nAll four are needed, also with the enhancer off: ComfyUI checks every loader before it starts. With the enhancer off the LLM is not loaded at all (only the Ministral encoder loads, checked in the ComfyUI log).\n**Faster option (tested on the two samples):** `ernie-image-turbo-fp8.safetensors` from [Bedovyy/ERNIE-Image-Quantized](https://huggingface.co/Bedovyy/ERNIE-Image-Quantized/resolve/main/ernie-image-turbo-fp8.safetensors) (8.22 GB, community quant) in `diffusion_models/`, picked in the model loader: 24 s and 10 s instead of 29 s and 14 s in the 12 GiB budget; same composition and text, small differences in detail.\n\n**VRAM:** Measured with ComfyUI's VRAM budget on a 24 GB card: in a 12 GiB budget ComfyUI used 12.2 GiB, in a 10 GiB budget 10.2 GiB, both gave the same picture as an unlimited run. Not verified on a real 12 GB card. Models that do not fit are kept in system RAM: the four files are 31 GB, so 32 GB of RAM or more is safer (not tested with less).\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3** (ERNIE-Image support needs 0.19.1 or newer; older versions were not tested). **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: ERNIE-Image-Turbo is Apache 2.0.\n"
   ]
  }
